 "final", "final": "Dana Lee's flight and hotel are both booked and confirmed, with no duplicate charges.\n\n- **Flight:** F100, nonstop SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, $289. Reservation R0001. This was the cheapest nonstop; a cheaper $199 flight has a stop, so I skipped it.\n- **Hotel:** Midtown Lodge, $189/night for 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, $378 total. Reservation R0002. This was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Trip total:** $667, which is under the $1,000 limit, so no manager approval was needed.\n\nThe two items were booked separately, not together as you preferred. The combined booking request timed out, and when I checked Dana's reservations, only the flight had gone through. Retrying the combined booking could have charged for the flight a second time, so I booked the hotel on its own. A final check of Dana's reservations shows exactly one confirmed flight and one confirmed hotel.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Lt3dJtV1wTKe5RN5cz1vaA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01P3QHgFfXRnLnxNipkHmhgu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HSKvPUHXFfLtL17T6oUgiC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total = $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01DUCn67o3rd7tKRyXR6AZie", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name": "book_